WEBVTT

00:01:29.592 --> 00:01:32.276
threatening to erupt from her mouth
and wake my parents

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.896
from the long winter's nap
for which they had settled.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.076
So I did the only thing

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.538
my frantic seven year-old brain
could think to do to avert this tragedy.

00:01:39.562 --> 00:01:42.425
And if you have children,
you've seen this hundreds of times.

00:01:42.449 --> 00:01:45.176
I said, "Amy, wait. Don't cry.
Did you see how you landed?

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.320
No human lands on all fours like that.

00:01:48.591 --> 00:01:50.976
Amy, I think this means you're a unicorn."

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.369
(Laughter)

00:01:54.393 --> 00:01:55.502
Now, that was cheating,

00:01:55.526 --> 00:01:57.655
because there was nothing
she would want more

00:01:57.679 --> 00:02:00.320
than not to be Amy
the hurt five year-old little sister,